#. Key:	3F35BCF64A8C62A1A0005C97F821BC22
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_A.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_A.Description
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_A.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_A.Description
msgctxt ",3F35BCF64A8C62A1A0005C97F821BC22"
msgid "모든 전투 참여자를 대상으로 포탄을 분산 배치해 전원에게 회피 행동을 요구하는 기본 견제 패턴입니다."
msgstr "A basic suppression pattern that spreads shells across all combatants, forcing everyone to evade."

#. Key:	92579E624B69203C62D075AFD7BEBE61
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_A.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_A.DisplayName
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_A.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_A.DisplayName
msgctxt ",92579E624B69203C62D075AFD7BEBE61"
msgid "전원 견제 포격"
msgstr "All-Target Suppression Barrage"

#. Key:	6FF0C5CB4BB5845230E6F69ECEB1E494
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_B.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_B.Description
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_B.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_B.Description
msgctxt ",6FF0C5CB4BB5845230E6F69ECEB1E494"
msgid "최고 위협도 대상을 중심으로 포탄을 집중 배치해 메인 어그로 대상에게 강한 압박을 주는 패턴입니다."
msgstr "A pattern that concentrates shells around the highest-threat target, placing heavy pressure on the primary aggro target."

#. Key:	52CD296241F28EBF468E3FABF2A4058D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_B.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_B.DisplayName
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_B.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_B.DisplayName
msgctxt ",52CD296241F28EBF468E3FABF2A4058D"
msgid "집중 포화"
msgstr "Focused Barrage"

#. Key:	2FAA859343CCCE88C81F47B0D152A381
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_C.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_C.Description
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_C.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_C.Description
msgctxt ",2FAA859343CCCE88C81F47B0D152A381"
msgid "플레이어 사이 공간을 공격해 파티가 한곳에 뭉치는 상황을 막고 진형 분리를 유도하는 패턴입니다."
msgstr "A pattern that attacks the spaces between players, preventing the party from grouping together and forcing the formation apart."

#. Key:	D56D9D664614435EAFE51684138F2B29
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_C.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_C.DisplayName
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_C.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_C.DisplayName
msgctxt ",D56D9D664614435EAFE51684138F2B29"
msgid "분산 강제 포격"
msgstr "Formation-Breaking Barrage"

#. Key:	7C4CD9B845FC0FAF7CE4CEB99CDA86E6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_D.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_D.Description
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_D.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_D.Description
msgctxt ",7C4CD9B845FC0FAF7CE4CEB99CDA86E6"
msgid "보스 또는 아레나 중심에서 링 형태의 포격을 순차 폭발시켜 전장 이동 타이밍을 요구하는 패턴입니다."
msgstr "A pattern that detonates ring-shaped barrages in sequence from the boss or arena center, requiring timed movement across the battlefield."

#. Key:	5B341EDE45AE111439F6708146D57649
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_D.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_D.DisplayName
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_D.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_D.DisplayName
msgctxt ",5B341EDE45AE111439F6708146D57649"
msgid "파동 포격"
msgstr "Wave Barrage"

#. Key:	E38BEBB14B8EB80A10C362B952B276B2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_E.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_E.Description
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_E.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_E.Description
msgctxt ",E38BEBB14B8EB80A10C362B952B276B2"
msgid "빠른 폭발과 늦은 폭발을 섞어 첫 회피 후 복귀하는 플레이를 견제하는 리듬 교란 패턴입니다."
msgstr "A rhythm-disruption pattern that mixes fast and delayed explosions to punish players who return immediately after the first dodge."

#. Key:	40B6A1144717F6D510C3BA850F9DEE7F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_E.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_E.DisplayName
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/AI/Artillery/DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_E.DA_TitanWalker_Artillery_E.DisplayName
msgctxt ",40B6A1144717F6D510C3BA850F9DEE7F"
msgid "엇박 포격"
msgstr "Offbeat Barrage"

