#. Key:	C0C9F7E24FFB36B7AB6FE492E62A092E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Engineer.CharacterDescription
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Engineer.CharacterDescription
msgctxt ",C0C9F7E24FFB36B7AB6FE492E62A092E"
msgid "연발 샷건과 자동 터렛으로 전장을 장악하고, 방어막으로 자신 및 터렛을 보호하는 설치형 전투원입니다. 오버클럭으로 자신과 터렛의 화력을 함께 끌어올립니다."
msgstr "A deployable-focused combatant who controls the battlefield with a rapid-fire shotgun and automated turret, protecting both with a barrier. Overclock boosts the firepower of the player and their turret."

#. Key:	1FC30E364EBB3EC1D546E5A5C5B01A52
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Engineer.CharacterName
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Engineer.CharacterName
msgctxt ",1FC30E364EBB3EC1D546E5A5C5B01A52"
msgid "엔지니어"
msgstr "Engineer"

#. Key:	98221C7148679DA3C5ACCBAC16A72FAC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Ranger.CharacterDescription
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Ranger.CharacterDescription
msgctxt ",98221C7148679DA3C5ACCBAC16A72FAC"
msgid "연발 소총과 폭발 무기로 지속 화력과 범위 피해를 제공하는 원거리 전투원입니다. 전투 가속으로 발사 및 재장전 속도를 높여 끊임없이 적을 압박합니다."
msgstr "A ranged combatant who provides sustained firepower and area damage with an automatic rifle and explosive weapons. Combat Acceleration increases fire and reload speeds to maintain relentless pressure."

#. Key:	54A91232428FABE69E03F4BE04402703
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Ranger.CharacterName
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Ranger.CharacterName
msgctxt ",54A91232428FABE69E03F4BE04402703"
msgid "레인저"
msgstr "Ranger"

#. Key:	BC48DB3A4F2C7B6F75FF27B7ABF22D32
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Vanguard.CharacterDescription
#: /Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Vanguard.CharacterDescription
msgctxt ",BC48DB3A4F2C7B6F75FF27B7ABF22D32"
msgid "광선검 공격과 다양한 기동 공격으로 적진을 돌파하는 근접 선봉장입니다. 배리어 필드로 전장을 지키고, 자신과 주변 아군을 강화해 전선을 이끕니다."
msgstr "A melee vanguard who breaks through enemy lines with beam sword attacks and agile maneuvers. Holds the battlefield with a barrier field and leads the front by empowering the player and nearby allies."

#. Key:	9D8395E14601AD8AA4BB40AB669B9FE5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NeoSanctum/Data/UI/DT_CharacterList.DT_CharacterList.Vanguard.CharacterName
